<VI _name="lvtd_rep_nested.vi" description="Fixture helper\3A bind a .ctl onto ONE element inside a cluster control\2C selected by label at both levels\2C then save the owning file in place.\0A\0AThis is the CONNECT gesture - {LV.Control} Replace with a Path - and it is how a nested typedef is built without the IDE. The descent needs To More Specific Class onto ref{LV.Cluster}\2C because Controls[] is declared on {LV.Cluster} and not on {LV.Control}.\0A\0ANothing is read back after the Replace\3A that method invalidates the reference it was called on\2C and the error would travel down the wire and stop Save.Instrument. Save.Instrument with an UNWIRED path saves the file in place. The labels seen at both levels are returned so the caller can check that Search 1D Array matched - an unmatched label gives -1 and Index Array then clamps to element 0\2C which would silently replace the wrong one.">
